[statement]
Of the removals left for last, a package needed through a name it provides
at a version goes first, and the packages it frees after it, the one the
installed database lists last first: `r` 2 no longer needs `so:g`, which
`g` provides at a version; `g` needs `gi` and `guic`, listed in that
order. apk removes `g`, `guic`, then `gi`. With the database listing
`guic` first, it removes `g`, `gi`, then `guic`.

[repository]
P:r
V:2

[installed]
P:gi
V:1

P:guic
V:1

P:g
V:1
p:so:g=1
D:gi guic

P:r
V:1
D:so:g

[world]
r

[request]
r>1

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
upgrade r 1 2
remove g 1
remove guic 1
remove gi 1
